<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Santa Rosa, Calif., $10.065 mln.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Santa Rosa, Calif., $10.065 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stone &amp; Youngberg LLC said it priced</p>
<p>$10.065 million of Santa Rosa, Calif., certificates of participation,</p>
<p>redevelopment agency financing project, 1996 series B, with a top</p>
<p>yield of 7.42 percent in 2024.</p>
</text>
